---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Página no encontrada | Moisés Magariño"
    description="Esta página no está disponible. Vuelve al portafolio de Moisés Magariño."
    robots="noindex, follow"
>
    <section class="not-found">
        <div class="not-found-mark" aria-hidden="true">404</div>
        <p class="not-found-eyebrow">Fuera de encuadre</p>
        <h1>Esta página no aparece en la toma.</h1>
        <p class="not-found-copy">
            Puede que el enlace haya cambiado o que el momento ya haya pasado.
            Volvamos a encontrar el camino.
        </p>
        <div class="not-found-actions">
            <a class="not-found-primary" href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
            <a class="not-found-secondary" href="/#galeria">Explorar la galería</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .not-found {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        min-height: min(75svh, 52rem);
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        isolation: isolate;
    }

    .not-found::before,
    .not-found::after {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: -1;
        content: "";
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .not-found::before {
        inset: 12% 15%;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgb(167 173 180 / 12%), transparent 68%);
    }

    .not-found::after {
        width: min(66vw, 38rem);
        height: min(66vw, 38rem);
        border: 1px solid rgb(217 220 223 / 9%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow:
            0 0 0 4rem rgb(217 220 223 / 2%),
            0 0 0 8rem rgb(217 220 223 / 1%);
    }

    .not-found-mark {
        color: rgb(217 220 223 / 9%);
        font-size: clamp(8rem, 29vw, 23rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.12em;
        line-height: 0.8;
        user-select: none;
    }

    .not-found-eyebrow {
        margin: -0.2em 0 1rem;
        color: #a7adb4;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.24em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .not-found h1 {
        max-width: 13ch;
        margin: 0;
        color: #f3f4f6;
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .not-found-copy {
        max-width: 35rem;
        margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
        color: #bfc3c7;
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .not-found-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .not-found-actions a {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 3rem;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
        color: #e3e6e8;
        border: 1px solid rgb(217 220 223 / 55%);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
    }

    .not-found-actions a:hover {
        color: #0d0f13;
        background: #e3e6e8;
    }

    .not-found-primary {
        color: #0d0f13 !important;
        background: #d9dcdf;
    }

    .not-found-primary:hover {
        background: #fff;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .not-found-actions a {
            transition: none;
        }
    }
</style>
